/mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></menclose><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></menclose><mo>−</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></menclose><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></menclose><mo>−</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></menclose><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></menclose><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p>Therefore,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1036\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-munderover space=\"2\"><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.111em; padding-left: 0.559em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-over><mjx-box><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2211 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.086em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D458 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder></mjx-box></mjx-munderover><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D458 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mn>3</mn><munderover><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>q</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
  "name": "Question 52",
  "problem": "Let $P={{z}_{0},{z}_{1},…,{z}_{q}}$ be a partition of the interval $[1,5].$ If $Δ{z}_{k}={z}_{k}-{z}_{k-1},$ calculate ${\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}3Δ{z}_{k}.$",
  "result": "Skipped Question",
  "worked_solution": "First, we take the factor $3$ outside the summation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}3Δ{z}_{k}=3{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that ${\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k}$ is just the length of the interval $[1,5],$ because\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k} & =({z}_{1}-{z}_{0})+({z}_{2}-{z}_{1})+({z}_{3}-{z}_{2})+⋯+({z}_{q}-{z}_{q-1}) \\\\  & =(\\cancel{{z}_{1}}-{z}_{0})+(\\cancel{{z}_{2}}-\\cancel{{z}_{1}})+(\\cancel{{z}_{3}}-\\cancel{{z}_{2}})+⋯+({z}_{q}-\\cancel{{z}_{q-1}}) \\\\  & =-{z}_{0}+{z}_{q} \\\\  & ={z}_{q}-{z}_{0} \\\\  & =5-1 \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n3{\\sum }_{k=1}^{q}Δ{z}_{k}=3\\cdot 4=12.\n$$"
}